<report>
<title>Probit analysis - further statistics</title>

<p>Iterations = @itr</p>

<p>Sxx = @{sxx:roundu}<br />
Sxy = @{sxy:roundu}<br />
Syy = @{syy:roundu}</p>

<p>Variance of B = @{var_b:roundu}<br />
Standard error of B @het = @{seb:roundu}</p>
<block name="natural">

<p>Estimated natural response rate (C) = @{c:roundu}<br />
Standard error of B @het_c = @{seb_c:roundu}</p>
</block>

<table>
<tr><th>Index</th><th>Subjects</th><th>Responses</th><th>Expected</th><th>Deviation</th></tr>
<block name="obs"><tr><td>@obs</td><td>@{sub:roundu}</td><td>@{res:roundu}</td><td>@{exp:roundu}</td><td>@{dev:roundu}</td></tr></block>
</table>
</report>
